#: admin/settings-view.php:36
msgid "Login as a User is a powerful WordPress plugin that lets you instantly access any user’s account with just one click — no password needed. Perfect for support, QA, and admin teams, it allows you to see exactly what your users see, making issue resolution faster and easier. Seamlessly integrated with WooCommerce and supporting role-based restrictions, it ensures both flexibility and security. Say goodbye to guesswork and endless email threads, support users in real time, from their exact perspective."
msgstr ""

